WEBVTT

03:00.870 --> 03:02.680
The Northern Wasteland army is attacking.

03:02.680 --> 03:03.150
General,

03:03.150 --> 03:04.120
what should we do?

03:04.120 --> 03:06.000
Send word to the court
and the general immediately

03:06.000 --> 03:08.030
to report the crisis at Immortal Pass.

03:08.030 --> 03:08.560
Yes, sir.

03:10.590 --> 03:13.630
Daxi and the Northern Wasteland
has agreed to peace talks.

03:13.630 --> 03:16.030
Why have you broken your promise

03:16.310 --> 03:17.520
and gone back on your word?

03:17.520 --> 03:18.560
A nobody like you

03:18.960 --> 03:20.630
is not worthy to speak with me.

03:21.120 --> 03:23.870
The agreement was made with Wu Jie.

03:24.430 --> 03:25.870
Now that he's gone,

03:26.310 --> 03:29.190
the agreement naturally becomes void!

03:29.520 --> 03:30.360
The general hasn't returned,

03:30.360 --> 03:31.360
and we haven't received the order.

03:31.360 --> 03:32.620
What are we going to do?

03:32.680 --> 03:34.079
Behind the Immortal Pass

03:34.310 --> 03:35.840
lies the heartland of Daxi.

03:35.870 --> 03:37.630
Our fathers, mothers,
and loved ones are there.

03:37.630 --> 03:38.470
Even if we die,

03:38.870 --> 03:41.280
we cannot let the Northern Wastelanders
through the pass.

03:41.280 --> 03:43.120
We must hold the gates at all costs.

03:43.120 --> 03:48.120
Defend! Defend! Defend!

03:48.680 --> 03:49.910
Attack!

03:56.520 --> 03:58.079
Kill!

03:59.190 --> 04:01.120
Kill!

04:18.510 --> 04:20.430
Kill!

04:24.360 --> 04:25.430
Attack!

05:35.750 --> 05:36.880
Where is General Wu?

05:38.270 --> 05:39.720
He's still fine for now.

05:41.000 --> 05:43.190
But who knows for how much longer?

05:46.000 --> 05:46.950
Qiushui.

05:48.920 --> 05:51.050
The moment
you stepped into this camp,

05:51.800 --> 05:54.870
you've sent him to his grave.

05:58.390 --> 06:00.510
Don't you think you're so capable,

06:00.920 --> 06:04.040
wanting to be a hero
who saves the country and its people?

06:04.040 --> 06:05.370
Today, I'll tell you...

06:07.510 --> 06:09.310
You won't accomplish anything.

06:11.360 --> 06:13.120
Where is General Wu?

06:20.040 --> 06:21.600
Do you think you can beat me?

06:23.630 --> 06:25.560
Winning or losing doesn't matter.

06:26.000 --> 06:27.720
Tell me where General Wu is.

06:35.750 --> 06:36.870
Why the rush?

06:48.680 --> 06:51.080
We don't have much time left
for General Wu.

06:52.950 --> 06:53.950
If you defeat me,

06:56.070 --> 06:57.360
I'll tell you.

07:26.360 --> 07:28.120
General! General! General!

07:28.270 --> 07:29.000
Terrible news!

07:29.000 --> 07:31.260
Ambushers are attacking the inner city!

07:31.870 --> 07:32.470
General!

07:32.750 --> 07:33.280
General,

07:33.560 --> 07:34.920
the city gates have been breached!

07:34.920 --> 07:35.920
Fall back to defend the inner city!

07:35.920 --> 07:38.190
Kill!

07:38.190 --> 07:39.630
Kill!

07:39.630 --> 07:50.360
Kill!

07:55.270 --> 07:56.310
Xiao Kaiyan.

07:59.480 --> 08:01.210
It's time to end things for you.

10:08.240 --> 10:09.960
Another stroke of luck?

11:52.910 --> 11:54.510
You think you've won.

11:56.550 --> 11:57.550
Xiao Qiushui.

11:58.870 --> 12:00.720
You want to save General Wu,

12:00.720 --> 12:02.750
but I refuse to tell you.

12:03.270 --> 12:05.080
What can you do about it?

12:10.480 --> 12:11.870
Hand over General Wu.

12:28.510 --> 12:29.270
Kaiyan.

12:30.270 --> 12:31.120
Kaiyan.

12:38.200 --> 12:38.720
Father?

12:39.320 --> 12:39.870
Father.

12:40.390 --> 12:41.480
Kaiyan,

12:42.200 --> 12:43.600
among my three children,

12:44.630 --> 12:46.360
you are the most reliable.

12:47.750 --> 12:49.240
Since Huanhua has you,

12:50.120 --> 12:52.440
I can rest easy.

12:53.960 --> 12:54.630
Father.

12:55.440 --> 12:56.080
Kaiyan,

12:56.440 --> 12:57.770
why are you back so late?

12:57.870 --> 12:58.720
Are you hungry?

12:58.720 --> 12:59.550
What would you like to eat?

12:59.550 --> 13:01.280
I'll make it for you right away.

13:01.550 --> 13:03.200
Mother!

13:06.200 --> 13:07.870
Mother, Yiren!

13:07.870 --> 13:08.510
Kaiyan,

13:09.030 --> 13:10.440
I got you a good sword.

13:10.840 --> 13:11.770
Come take a look!

13:17.910 --> 13:18.720
Kaiyan.

13:20.000 --> 13:20.720
Kaiyan,

13:21.550 --> 13:24.360
we agreed to venture
into the martial world together.

13:24.360 --> 13:25.440
Let's go now.

13:50.320 --> 13:51.720
Xiao Qiushui!

13:52.000 --> 13:54.080
Xiao Qiushui!

14:15.600 --> 14:16.840
You took shortcuts,

14:16.910 --> 14:18.200
absorbing others' energy,

14:18.200 --> 14:19.720
which led you astray

14:19.750 --> 14:21.750
and killed so many innocent people.

14:22.480 --> 14:24.480
When there is no self in one's heart,

14:24.550 --> 14:26.840
only then can you understand
heaven and earth.

14:26.840 --> 14:28.630
By showing compassion for others,

14:28.630 --> 14:31.360
only then can you connect with
all living beings.

14:31.510 --> 14:33.970
You've only ever seen yourself
in your eyes.

14:35.240 --> 14:37.170
How could you possibly understand

14:38.550 --> 14:40.550
that the highest state of Voidheart

14:41.150 --> 14:42.550
is actually compassion?

14:51.440 --> 14:52.480
Qiushui.

14:54.840 --> 14:56.240
I see...

14:59.150 --> 15:00.600
it's snowing.

15:03.080 --> 15:04.010
Second Brother.

15:06.630 --> 15:08.830
This is the last time I'll call you that.

15:12.000 --> 15:14.200
I'm the only one left in the Xiao family.

15:16.230 --> 15:17.510
I will now make amends

15:18.720 --> 15:20.670
for the mistakes you made.

15:22.510 --> 15:23.510
Tell me

15:25.120 --> 15:26.750
where General Wu is.

15:31.480 --> 15:32.720
Tell me

15:33.670 --> 15:35.510
where General Wu is!

15:38.360 --> 15:39.440
General Wu...

15:42.030 --> 15:42.840
Is...

15:45.240 --> 15:46.000
Is...

16:33.270 --> 16:34.600
The outcome is decided.

16:35.270 --> 16:36.080
Immortal Pass

16:36.600 --> 16:39.060
already belongs to the Northern Wasteland.

16:39.080 --> 16:40.270
Your desperate struggle

16:40.270 --> 16:41.630
will only lead to death.

16:42.120 --> 16:44.550
We swear to defend Daxi to the death,

16:44.910 --> 16:46.480
unwavering in our commitment!

16:46.480 --> 16:48.320
-Unwavering commitment!
-Unwavering commitment!

16:48.320 --> 16:51.250
-Unwavering commitment!
-Unwavering commitment!

16:52.510 --> 16:53.840
You're nothing but

16:54.240 --> 16:55.630
Wu Jie's remnant forces.

16:55.630 --> 16:57.000
Damn Northern Wastelanders,

16:57.000 --> 16:58.390
get out of Daxi!

16:58.390 --> 16:59.910
-Get out of Daxi!
-Get out of Daxi!

16:59.910 --> 17:01.390
-Get out of Daxi!
-Get out of Daxi!

17:01.390 --> 17:03.240
-Get out of Daxi!
-Get out of Daxi!

17:03.240 --> 17:05.069
Foolish commoners blind to the times,

17:05.069 --> 17:07.800
even Daxi's emperor
is willing to cede territory

17:07.960 --> 17:09.160
for temporary peace!

17:09.349 --> 17:10.950
Will anyone come to save you?

17:11.589 --> 17:14.109
Move aside or I'll kill you all.

17:26.109 --> 17:28.960
I, Liang Dou, have brought
Daxi's martial world

17:29.440 --> 17:31.070
to guard the nation's gate.

17:31.510 --> 17:32.720
I'd like to see

17:33.160 --> 17:35.200
whether Daxi's martial world is formidable

17:35.200 --> 17:37.000
or if the Northern Wasteland's experts

17:37.000 --> 17:38.070
are more superior.

17:38.350 --> 17:38.920
Attack!

19:19.400 --> 19:20.310
Qiushui.

19:27.070 --> 19:28.440
General!

19:28.590 --> 19:29.960
It's the General!

20:01.960 --> 20:03.400
All soldiers, hear my command!

20:03.400 --> 20:06.200
-Yes, sir!
-Yes, sir!

20:07.000 --> 20:09.440
Follow me
and fight our way out of the city!

20:09.440 --> 20:33.880
Charge!

21:01.310 --> 21:09.680
Charge!

22:24.270 --> 22:24.830
Guards,

22:25.350 --> 22:26.440
summon Li Chenzhou.

22:26.440 --> 22:29.030
Tell him to rescue
General Wu at all costs!

22:29.030 --> 22:30.110
Your Majesty!

22:30.720 --> 22:31.880
Great victory!

22:32.350 --> 22:33.150
Your Majesty.

22:33.480 --> 22:34.110
Your Majesty,

22:34.110 --> 22:36.030
victory at Immortal Pass!

22:38.030 --> 22:38.830
Your Majesty,

22:39.030 --> 22:40.350
in the battle at Immortal Pass,

22:40.350 --> 22:42.880
Wu Jie defeated
the Northern Wasteland Army!

22:43.070 --> 22:44.550
The Northern Wasteland Army's general,

22:44.550 --> 22:46.680
Helian Yan, was beheaded.

22:47.270 --> 22:49.200
The Northern Wasteland has surrendered

22:49.200 --> 22:52.460
and promised not to invade
the Central Plains for 50 years!

22:52.880 --> 22:53.400
Good.

22:53.920 --> 22:54.680
Very good!

22:55.030 --> 22:55.880
Issue the order:

22:55.880 --> 22:57.680
Reward Wu Jie
and the frontline soldiers generously.

22:57.680 --> 22:58.160
Yes, Your Majesty.

22:58.160 --> 22:58.790
Wait.

23:00.070 --> 23:00.920
And Chenzhou

23:01.400 --> 23:02.730
should be rewarded too.

23:03.680 --> 23:04.510
Your Majesty,

23:05.400 --> 23:07.480
Chief Li has already...

23:09.000 --> 23:10.920
While searching for General Wu,

23:11.680 --> 23:12.920
he died.

23:13.880 --> 23:14.810
What did you say?

23:22.750 --> 23:23.680
Chenzhou...

24:12.590 --> 24:13.830
Thank you, Mr. Xiao.

24:15.350 --> 24:16.030
General Wu.

24:25.830 --> 24:29.270
The Xiao family honors promises.
You risked your life to save me.

24:29.270 --> 24:31.920
I will never forget
this debt of gratitude.

24:39.440 --> 24:40.350
Come.

24:40.510 --> 24:41.070
Drink!

24:42.200 --> 24:44.260
Let me drink first to show my respect!

24:44.790 --> 24:46.070
Come, I'll join you.

24:46.440 --> 24:47.240
Good wine!

24:49.680 --> 24:50.720
Wu Army!

24:51.350 --> 24:52.070
Here!

24:52.270 --> 24:53.000
Here!

24:53.310 --> 24:53.960
Here!

24:56.880 --> 24:57.550
Mr. Xiao,

24:57.880 --> 24:59.610
on behalf of the entire Wu Army,

24:59.640 --> 25:01.510
I toast to
your Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood!

25:01.510 --> 25:02.030
Cheers!

25:02.200 --> 25:05.000
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

25:05.000 --> 25:07.510
Bottoms up!

25:07.510 --> 25:08.200
Bottoms up!

25:08.640 --> 25:10.920
Cheers!

25:10.920 --> 25:11.580
Bottoms up!

25:23.550 --> 25:24.680
Thank you, Mr. Xiao.

25:28.680 --> 25:30.000
Such good wine!

25:30.750 --> 25:32.150
Let's drink till we drop.

25:39.160 --> 25:41.000
Cheers!

25:41.000 --> 25:41.590
Come!

25:42.750 --> 25:43.480
Brothers.

25:46.750 --> 25:47.480
This cup

25:47.920 --> 25:51.160
is to all our brothers
who died fighting the Northern Wasteland.

25:51.160 --> 25:52.090
Today's victory

25:53.680 --> 25:55.080
is partly theirs as well.

26:13.590 --> 26:14.350
This one...

26:19.350 --> 26:20.810
Let's drink to ourselves.

26:24.510 --> 26:25.750
To ourselves!

26:27.350 --> 26:28.720
-Good!
-Drink!

26:29.270 --> 26:30.480
To ourselves!

26:30.550 --> 26:32.000
To ourselves!

26:32.400 --> 26:32.880
Come!

26:33.310 --> 26:33.790
Come!

26:51.720 --> 26:52.550
- Go.
- Go.

26:53.830 --> 26:54.510
Let's go drink over there.

26:54.510 --> 26:55.550
Let's drink with those guys.

26:55.550 --> 26:56.080
Let's go.

26:57.310 --> 26:58.440
I'm telling you all,

26:58.680 --> 27:00.750
we're no longer the Four Thugs.

27:00.750 --> 27:01.680
We're now the Five Thugs...

27:01.680 --> 27:03.030
Five, Six Thugs now!

27:03.310 --> 27:05.920
We were like this and then like that.

27:08.000 --> 27:08.510
Drink!

27:14.240 --> 27:15.370
No one leaves sober!

27:17.510 --> 27:18.680
Come on, drink up!

27:18.680 --> 27:19.880
Come on, have a drink!

27:20.160 --> 27:20.960
Here, pour some more.

27:20.960 --> 27:21.830
Come on.

27:23.030 --> 27:23.640
Good.

27:26.000 --> 27:27.000
Great tolerance!

27:30.240 --> 27:32.510
Here, like this, and again.

27:47.590 --> 27:48.310
Tang Fang.

27:59.830 --> 28:00.480
Qiushui.

28:03.350 --> 28:07.640
Knowing you
is the greatest joy of my life.

28:29.030 --> 28:29.960
Your family master

28:29.960 --> 28:31.480
doesn't allow women to marry out.

28:31.480 --> 28:33.480
Then can you have a husband marry in?

28:33.510 --> 28:34.110
Well...

28:34.920 --> 28:36.180
A live-in son-in-law?

28:36.400 --> 28:38.200
Big Brother, Second, Fourth Brothers,
come here quick.

28:38.200 --> 28:39.750
Zuoqiu is going to be
a live-in son-in-law!

28:39.750 --> 28:41.920
Zuoqiu is marrying into the Qu family!

28:42.070 --> 28:44.510
Will their children
have to take the Qu surname?

28:44.510 --> 28:45.310
That's fine.

28:45.960 --> 28:47.400
What's wrong with the Qu surname?

28:47.400 --> 28:48.720
I'm not jealous at all.

28:49.310 --> 28:50.400
We have Fifth Thug.

28:50.480 --> 28:51.880
We'll live together
with Fifth Thug from now on.

28:51.880 --> 28:53.550
Right, we'll live with Fifth Thug.

28:53.550 --> 28:55.070
Won't that make us five bachelors?

28:55.070 --> 28:56.720
Five bachelors it is then.

28:58.920 --> 29:01.550
Fourth Brother,
you're not stuttering anymore.

29:01.550 --> 29:02.440
You're right.

29:03.110 --> 29:04.510
Come on, drink more.

29:05.510 --> 29:06.240
Big Brother.

29:06.550 --> 29:07.270
Miss Tang.

29:07.750 --> 29:09.160
Let's enjoy the wine while we can.

29:09.160 --> 29:10.290
Let me toast you two.

29:27.480 --> 29:28.480
This feels great.

29:32.310 --> 29:34.640
Who says our Fifth Thug must be bachelors?

29:35.030 --> 29:35.790
I'm not.

29:36.880 --> 29:38.080
Everything for Daxi.

29:38.790 --> 29:39.680
Each of them

29:40.440 --> 29:42.070
is a great hero of Daxi.

29:56.480 --> 29:57.750
Qiushui!

29:59.070 --> 29:59.720
Miss Tang.

29:59.830 --> 30:01.230
I'd like to toast you two.

30:02.030 --> 30:04.310
May you enjoy your drinks!

30:05.110 --> 30:05.910
I'll drink up.

30:13.000 --> 30:13.680
Qiushui,

30:14.030 --> 30:15.110
on such a wonderful day,

30:15.110 --> 30:17.200
let's sing a song together!

30:18.270 --> 30:18.800
Alright!

30:19.720 --> 30:20.720
Brothers.

30:22.070 --> 30:24.480
Let's sing together now.

30:24.960 --> 30:25.680
Time to sing.

30:25.680 --> 30:26.400
You start first.

30:26.400 --> 30:27.460
-You start.
-Sure!

31:56.160 --> 31:56.960
Xiao Qiushui,

31:58.590 --> 31:59.310
you've won.

32:07.480 --> 32:08.540
The martial world,

32:08.960 --> 32:11.690
at the end of the day,
is united by righteousness.

32:11.830 --> 32:13.830
I see a different martial world too.

32:45.000 --> 32:46.270
Xiao Qiushui.

32:48.960 --> 32:51.560
We'll meet
when fate brings us together again.

34:50.400 --> 34:51.670
Qiushui knew well

34:51.920 --> 34:53.150
that using the Voidheart Codex

34:53.150 --> 34:55.030
at the 15th level
would have consequences.

34:55.030 --> 34:56.230
Although it could unleash

34:56.230 --> 34:58.510
power several times
beyond his own strength,

34:58.510 --> 35:00.570
making him temporarily invincible,

35:00.800 --> 35:03.230
it would drain
his vital energy completely,

35:03.230 --> 35:06.400
damaging his meridians
and depleting his life force soon after.

35:06.400 --> 35:09.630
He paid with his life!

35:45.230 --> 35:47.880
Mingming, after thorough investigation,

35:48.320 --> 35:50.760
we've confirmed
Li Nan's espionage activities.

35:50.760 --> 35:52.630
He was acting under orders
from a foreign spy organization

35:52.630 --> 35:53.960
to steal state secrets.

35:54.440 --> 35:56.760
Unfortunately,
before he could be sentenced,

35:56.760 --> 35:58.630
he died two days ago.
